flowchart TD
    P[Authorized payment confirmation] --> U[Conditional confirm pending settlement]
    U -->|One row updated| E[Create repayment and publish settlement event]
    U -->|No row updated| R[Reload trusted settlement]

    R --> C{Observed outcome}
    C -->|Confirmed by same intent| I[Idempotent success]
    C -->|Confirmed by another intent| X[SETTLEMENT_STATE_CONFLICT 409]
    C -->|Expired failed or cancelled| X
    C -->|Missing| N[SETTLEMENT_NOT_FOUND 404]

    E --> M[Commit payment settlement outbox and audit]
    I --> K[Commit without duplicate effects]
    X --> B[Roll back payment attempt and intent]
    N --> B

    B --> Z[No repayment outbox notification or audit effect]
